  "albumInformation": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14.666666666666666px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;\">If you want to use our music for project or what not. all we ask is that you like our Facebook page. Thank you.\"In 1982 Los Angeles punk band The Bad Plants released their debut album Nerve Damage. Now you can hear that music, relive the 1982 L.A. punk scene of Black Flag and the Minutemen. The Bad Plants were a mix of Dead Kennedys and a headache, but were more than happy to dive into more of the untouched corners of Punk. Willing to slow down the tempo to a drag, and willing to strip back the growl when they had to the Bad Plants created an album that was Punk but with variety\" </span></p>",
